  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx4 + (16)/(x⁴) = 15617\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n(a + b)² = a² + b² + 2ab\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nx4 + (16)/(x⁴) = 15617\n\n⇒ (x²)2 + ((4)/(x²))² = 15617\n\n⇒ (x2)2 + ((4)/(x²))² + 2 × x2 × ((4)/(x²)) = 15617 + 2 × x2 × ((4)/(x²))\n\n⇒ (x2)2 + ((4)/(x²))² + 8 = 15617 + 8\n\n⇒ (x2 + (4)/(x²))² = 15625\n\n⇒ x2 + (4)/(x²) = 125\n\n⇒ (x)2 + ((2)/(x))² + 2 × x × ((2)/(x)) = 125 + 2 × x × ((2)/(x))\n\n⇒ (x)2 + ((2)/(x))² + 4 = 125 + 4\n\n⇒ (x + (2)/(x))² = 129\n\n⇒ x + (2)/(x) = sqrt{129}\n\n**∴ The required answer is sqrt{129}.**",
